#20501
A Path through the Forest~
  You are surrounded by tall pines that seem to reach up endlessly to the sky.
The sounds of the forrest are all around you.  The birds are singing, the bees
are buzzing, the wind whistles through the trees.  Butterfiles lazily float
along on updrafts of air.  Beams of sunshine pour down from between the 
branches of the trees.  Far in the distance you hear what sounds like hawks
crying.
~
