#20551
Foyer of the Keep~
  You walk into a lavishly decorated foyer.  Servants wait patiently in the
corners to attend to any arriving guests of a more noble stature.  Two mighty
columns rise up before you to the east and beyond them you can see a great hall
spanning to the north and south.  Further off in the distance you can faintly
see the outline of a throne.
~
