#20553
A Hallway~
  You are in a somewhat sparse hallway of the keep.  Only servants and lesser
guests come this way so time was not wasted on making it look pretty.  Every
few minuets a servant passes by, no doubt on his way to serve some important
noble within the keep.  The smell of fresh baked bread comes from the east.
~
