#20555
The Art Room~
  This is the kenku art room.  You are amazed at how huge this room is.  A
single rug covers the entire floor.  It's intricate patterns make you wonder
just how long the craftsman spent on it.  Various paintings line the walls as
well.  On the south wall above a roaring fireplace is the portrait of the King
and Queen of the Keep.
~
