#20557
The Kitchen~
  This is the Kenku kitchen.  Various knives and cooking utensils line the
racks along the walls.  In the middle of the room is a large stove with several
bubbling pots and pans on it.  The aroma is quite pleasing until you lift
one of the lids of a pot and peer inside.
~
