Great Hall~
  The tables extend into this area of the great hall also.  Platters of half
eaten food lay here from some past meal.  Shields representing various factions
of the Kenku warrios caste are lined all along the side of the wall.  A few
Kenku here are not happy about having their meal interuppted by strangers.
~
