The Queen's Bedroom~
  The Queen's bedroom is totaly pink.  It seems that she was so into the color
pink that even the wooden frame on her queen sized bed is made from the rare
wood pinkerstone.  Her dresser has many bottles of perfume and feather brushes
to keep her looking her best for the royal balls.  A small cameo of the King
sets on her nightstand.
~
